ShopMan: Hello there!
ShopMan: The fresh meat.. erm, the new rookie has arrived!
ShopMan: Pardon me, where are my manners? It's quite the pleasure to have you. You read the add thoroughly..
ShopMan: DIDN'T YOU?
ShopMan: Yes... of course you did! I only hire the cream of the crop.. *Except for the last rookie.. oh and maybe the last.. * erm, nevermind that. Just glad to have a fresh soul interested in the extermination business.. It's a dying trade you know!
ShopMan: Listen, kid. I won't beat around the bush, this is possibly the biggest call of a life time. We got a town with a full infestation of those killer mutant rats that we've been hearing in the newspaper as of recent! Yes, it's our job and our job only.. The other guys were to scared to show their faces - however, we ain't afraid if the pay is right.
ShopMan: Oh.. Sorry didn't mean to scare ya!
ShopMan: Hey don't leave! Things are just getting interesting. This is great training.. if you survive.. I mean, complete this job successfully, you'll have proven yourself a bonafide Exterminator!
ShopMan: Now, for some advice..
ShopMan: This is our base of operations - or you can call it the Hub for short! Use WASD keys to rotate yourself in 1 of four cardinal directions. You can CLICK on my shop cart here to access any of you weapon upgrades. Or ROTATE to the left to access the character campfire.
ShopMan: At the Character Campfire, you can use your Ability Points you acquire from Leveling your experience to become stronger and wipe those rats out even more efficiently than before!
ShopMan: When you're ready to fight, press 'R', choose a wave to fight, and you'll be on your way to greatness!
ShopMan: That's about it!
ShopMan: Oh? Why aren't I joining the fight you ask? Well, it's simple really. Someone needs to stay back and service any customers, and besides.. there's nothing like a hearty trial by fire to get a rookie up to speed! Good luck out there!
do CutSceneManager.show_hub_hud()